OL,3,AThe virtual worlds where robots are
OL,4,Atrained
OL,5,
OL,6,FFreddo the robot walks across the
OL,7,Foffice and takes a plastic bottle
OL,8,Foffered by a staff member.
OL,10,FGiven that a robot recently beat Usain
OL,11,FBolt's 100m sprint record, it's not the
OL,12,Fmost startling achievement.
OL,14,FBut the speed by which Freddo has been
OL,15,Ftrained to walk, recognise the bottle
OL,16,Fand grasp it is impressive. It took
OL,17,Fjust a few minutes to develop those
OL,18,Fskills and upload them to Freddo. His
OL,19,Fdevelopers say rival systems could take
OL,20,Fdays to attain such skills.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/19
