OL,3,ACate Blanchett asks theatre audience to
OL,4,Astop filming during show
OL,5,
OL,6,FA-list actress Cate Blanchett has
OL,7,Fbecome the latest star to make a plea
OL,8,Ffor theatre audiences to put their
OL,9,Fphones away during performances.
OL,11,FThe Australian film and stage actor and
OL,12,Fproducer was appearing at London's
OL,13,FNational Theatre in Electra/Persona.
OL,15,FDuring the curtain call on Friday,
OL,16,FBlanchett said: "There are few places
OL,17,Fon this planet where we can simply be
OL,18,Ftogether and be present.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,163,160,200,105,0,100
